VERDICT: APPROVED_WITH_COMMENTS
The submitted diff is acceptable for task completion, with minor follow-up notes.

Critical findings / analysis:
- The change adds two missing `</FeatureGate>` closures in `client/src/pages/dashboard.tsx` (CRM and Calendar sections), which resolves JSX structural/syntax issues in those tab blocks.
- Frontend production build succeeds after this fix, indicating the JSX parsing/bundling path is no longer blocked by these errors.
- The “install deps/configure secrets” part of the summary is not represented in committed project files, so that setup work is not auditable/reproducible from git alone.
- Full TypeScript check still reports multiple errors elsewhere in the repo, but these appear pre-existing and outside the scope of this targeted JSX fix.

Security:
- None observed in this diff.

Next actions:
1. Add brief setup documentation (required env vars, install/run steps) so environment preparation is reproducible by other developers.
2. Track existing TypeScript errors as a separate stabilization task to prevent future regressions from being masked.
3. If this task’s acceptance criteria includes runtime startup verification, include a short note/log artifact confirming successful boot on a free port.

